OL,3,AUS envoys meet Putin in Moscow for
OL,4,AUkraine talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's top
OL,7,Fnegotiators have met Russian President
OL,8,FVladimir Putin on a visit to Moscow for
OL,9,Fpeace talks.
OL,11,FVideo on Russian state media shows
OL,12,FSteve Witkoff and Jared Kushner being
OL,13,Fgreeted by Putin, as efforts to end the
OL,14,Fwar in Ukraine gather pace.
OL,16,FTrump told reporters on Friday that
OL,17,FWitkoff and Kushner were "bringing with
OL,18,Fthem a proposal to end the war". So
OL,19,Ffar, efforts from the US and its allies
OL,20,Fto broker a peace deal have failed. On
OL,21,FSunday they will travel to Kyiv for
OL,22,Fmore talks.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
